</span><span begin="1:48.377" end="1:49.641">你</span></p><p begin="1:49.881" end="1:52.121" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.881" end="1:50.172">我再</span><span begin="1:50.172" end="1:50.877">专心讨</span><span begin="1:50.877" end="1:51.063">好</span><span begin="1:51.063" end="1:52.121">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:58.463" end="2:00.531" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:58.463" end="2:00.531" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.463" end="1:59.519">祝福</span><span begin="1:59.519" end="2:00.531">你</span></p></div><div begin="2:05.844" end="2:21.000" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:05.844" end="2:09.467" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.844" end="2:06.474">是我</span><span begin="2:06.474" end="2:06.826">的</span><span begin="2:06.826" end="2:07.172">心</span><span begin="2:07.172" end="2:07.655">机</span> <span begin="2:07.784" end="2:08.276">若你</span><span begin="2:08.276" end="2:08.731">看</span><span begin="2:08.731" end="2:09.034">不</span><span begin="2:09.034" end="2:09.467">起</span></p><p begin="2:09.577" end="2:13.063" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.577" end="2:10.096">被你</span><span begin="2:10.096" end="2:10.327">偷</span><span begin="2:10.327" end="2:10.480">听</span> <span begin="2:10.480" end="2:11.857">都等于对我爱丽</span><span begin="2:11.857" end="2:12.193">斯</span><span begin="2:12.193" end="2:12.565">不</span><span begin="2:12.565" end="2:13.063">起</span></p><p begin="2:13.173" end="2:16.705" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.173" end="2:13.742">别对</span><span begin="2:13.742" end="2:14.146">我</span><span begin="2:14.146" end="2:14.445">生</span><span begin="2:14.445" end="2:14.884">气</span> <span begin="2:15.003" end="2:15.556">别怪</span><span begin="2:15.556" end="2:15.939">我</span><span begin="2:15.939" end="2:16.243">卑</span><span begin="2:16.243" end="2:16.705">鄙</span></p><p begin="2:16.755" end="2:21.000" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.755" end="2:17.3